[{"id":"hook-00","text":"I’m going to give an AI agent a simple task.","start":15,"end":85,"words":[{"w":"I’m","f":17},{"w":"going","f":22},{"w":"to","f":31},{"w":"give","f":36},{"w":"an","f":44},{"w":"AI","f":49},{"w":"agent","f":54},{"w":"a","f":63},{"w":"simple","f":67},{"w":"task.","f":77}]},{"id":"hook-01","text":"Find my project brief and summarize it.","start":140,"end":199,"words":[{"w":"Find","f":143},{"w":"my","f":150},{"w":"project","f":155},{"w":"brief","f":166},{"w":"and","f":175},{"w":"summarize","f":181},{"w":"it.","f":194}]},{"id":"hook-02","text":"To do that, it needs to search the workspace and read a file.","start":232,"end":320,"words":[{"w":"To","f":234},{"w":"do","f":239},{"w":"that,","f":243},{"w":"it","f":254},{"w":"needs","f":259},{"w":"to","f":266},{"w":"search","f":271},{"w":"the","f":280},{"w":"workspace","f":285},{"w":"and","f":297},{"w":"read","f":303},{"w":"a","f":310},{"w":"file.","f":313}]},{"id":"hook-03","text":"But suppose the same agent also has access to a tool that can delete an entire folder.","start":390,"end":529,"words":[{"w":"But","f":394},{"w":"suppose","f":400},{"w":"the","f":412},{"w":"same","f":419},{"w":"agent","f":426},{"w":"also","f":436},{"w":"has","f":443},{"w":"access","f":450},{"w":"to","f":460},{"w":"a","f":466},{"w":"tool","f":470},{"w":"that","f":477},{"w":"can","f":485},{"w":"delete","f":492},{"w":"an","f":502},{"w":"entire","f":508},{"w":"folder.","f":518}]},{"id":"hook-04","text":"What happens if it calls that tool while working on my request?","start":592,"end":675,"words":[{"w":"What","f":596},{"w":"happens","f":602},{"w":"if","f":611},{"w":"it","f":616},{"w":"calls","f":620},{"w":"that","f":627},{"w":"tool","f":633},{"w":"while","f":640},{"w":"working","f":647},{"w":"on","f":657},{"w":"my","f":661},{"w":"request?","f":665}]},{"id":"hook-05","text":"I could read the agent’s chat and hope it tells me what it did.","start":739,"end":819,"words":[{"w":"I","f":741},{"w":"could","f":744},{"w":"read","f":751},{"w":"the","f":757},{"w":"agent’s","f":763},{"w":"chat","f":771},{"w":"and","f":777},{"w":"hope","f":782},{"w":"it","f":788},{"w":"tells","f":792},{"w":"me","f":799},{"w":"what","f":803},{"w":"it","f":810},{"w":"did.","f":814}]},{"id":"hook-06","text":"By then, the files could already be gone.","start":908,"end":965,"words":[{"w":"By","f":911},{"w":"then,","f":915},{"w":"the","f":926},{"w":"files","f":931},{"w":"could","f":938},{"w":"already","f":945},{"w":"be","f":955},{"w":"gone.","f":959}]},{"id":"hook-07","text":"That’s the problem we’re solving with Safe-Mode Gateway for Track 1.","start":1011,"end":1105,"words":[{"w":"That’s","f":1014},{"w":"the","f":1022},{"w":"problem","f":1028},{"w":"we’re","f":1039},{"w":"solving","f":1046},{"w":"with","f":1057},{"w":"Safe-Mode","f":1064},{"w":"Gateway","f":1076},{"w":"for","f":1087},{"w":"Track","f":1093},{"w":"1.","f":1101}]},{"id":"hook-08","text":"It gives people a way to control what their AI agents can actually do.","start":1147,"end":1258,"words":[{"w":"It","f":1150},{"w":"gives","f":1155},{"w":"people","f":1164},{"w":"a","f":1174},{"w":"way","f":1178},{"w":"to","f":1184},{"w":"control","f":1190},{"w":"what","f":1201},{"w":"their","f":1209},{"w":"AI","f":1218},{"w":"agents","f":1223},{"w":"can","f":1233},{"w":"actually","f":1240},{"w":"do.","f":1253}]},{"id":"how-00","text":"MCP lets an AI agent connect to tools like file search, cloud storage, or a database.","start":1365,"end":1567,"words":[{"w":"MCP","f":1367},{"w":"lets","f":1376},{"w":"an","f":1388},{"w":"AI","f":1395},{"w":"agent","f":1403},{"w":"connect","f":1416},{"w":"to","f":1432},{"w":"tools","f":1440},{"w":"like","f":1453},{"w":"file","f":1464},{"w":"search,","f":1475},{"w":"cloud","f":1498},{"w":"storage,","f":1511},{"w":"or","f":1535},{"w":"a","f":1543},{"w":"database.","f":1548}]},{"id":"how-01","text":"Safe-Mode Gateway sits between the agent and those tools.","start":1574,"end":1666,"words":[{"w":"Safe-Mode","f":1575},{"w":"Gateway","f":1589},{"w":"sits","f":1601},{"w":"between","f":1610},{"w":"the","f":1622},{"w":"agent","f":1629},{"w":"and","f":1639},{"w":"those","f":1646},{"w":"tools.","f":1656}]},{"id":"how-02","text":"Every tool call that goes through the gateway gets checked before it runs.","start":1688,"end":1796,"words":[{"w":"Every","f":1690},{"w":"tool","f":1698},{"w":"call","f":1705},{"w":"that","f":1713},{"w":"goes","f":1720},{"w":"through","f":1728},{"w":"the","f":1739},{"w":"gateway","f":1745},{"w":"gets","f":1756},{"w":"checked","f":1763},{"w":"before","f":1774},{"w":"it","f":1784},{"w":"runs.","f":1789}]},{"id":"how-03","text":"We classify calls in three groups.","start":1840,"end":1899,"words":[{"w":"We","f":1843},{"w":"classify","f":1848},{"w":"calls","f":1862},{"w":"in","f":1872},{"w":"three","f":1878},{"w":"groups.","f":1887}]},{"id":"how-04","text":"Read actions retrieve information.","start":1924,"end":1983,"words":[{"w":"Read","f":1924},{"w":"actions","f":1933},{"w":"retrieve","f":1947},{"w":"information.","f":1963}]},{"id":"how-05","text":"Write actions change something, like renaming a file.","start":2007,"end":2100,"words":[{"w":"Write","f":2009},{"w":"actions","f":2019},{"w":"change","f":2032},{"w":"something,","f":2043},{"w":"like","f":2065},{"w":"renaming","f":2073},{"w":"a","f":2087},{"w":"file.","f":2092}]},{"id":"how-06","text":"Destructive actions can remove data, like deleting a folder.","start":2139,"end":2245,"words":[{"w":"Destructive","f":2140},{"w":"actions","f":2159},{"w":"can","f":2172},{"w":"remove","f":2179},{"w":"data,","f":2191},{"w":"like","f":2206},{"w":"deleting","f":2214},{"w":"a","f":2229},{"w":"folder.","f":2233}]},{"id":"how-07","text":"The operator sets the policy.","start":2268,"end":2319,"words":[{"w":"The","f":2271},{"w":"operator","f":2278},{"w":"sets","f":2292},{"w":"the","f":2300},{"w":"policy.","f":2307}]},{"id":"how-08","text":"In this demo, approved read tools run automatically.","start":2357,"end":2443,"words":[{"w":"In","f":2360},{"w":"this","f":2365},{"w":"demo,","f":2373},{"w":"approved","f":2386},{"w":"read","f":2399},{"w":"tools","f":2407},{"w":"run","f":2417},{"w":"automatically.","f":2423}]},{"id":"how-09","text":"A write or destructive action pauses for a decision.","start":2465,"end":2553,"words":[{"w":"A","f":2467},{"w":"write","f":2472},{"w":"or","f":2481},{"w":"destructive","f":2487},{"w":"action","f":2505},{"w":"pauses","f":2516},{"w":"for","f":2527},{"w":"a","f":2534},{"w":"decision.","f":2539}]},{"id":"how-10","text":"That means I can let the agent search ten files without clicking ten times, and still stop it at the moment it tries to change one.","start":2573,"end":2782,"words":[{"w":"That","f":2576},{"w":"means","f":2583},{"w":"I","f":2592},{"w":"can","f":2596},{"w":"let","f":2603},{"w":"the","f":2609},{"w":"agent","f":2616},{"w":"search","f":2625},{"w":"ten","f":2635},{"w":"files","f":2641},{"w":"without","f":2650},{"w":"clicking","f":2662},{"w":"ten","f":2675},{"w":"times,","f":2681},{"w":"and","f":2695},{"w":"still","f":2702},{"w":"stop","f":2711},{"w":"it","f":2719},{"w":"at","f":2724},{"w":"the","f":2729},{"w":"moment","f":2735},{"w":"it","f":2746},{"w":"tries","f":2751},{"w":"to","f":2760},{"w":"change","f":2765},{"w":"one.","f":2775}]},{"id":"allow-block-00","text":"Here’s the original task.","start":2865,"end":2903,"words":[{"w":"Here’s","f":2869},{"w":"the","f":2877},{"w":"original","f":2884},{"w":"task.","f":2896}]},{"id":"allow-block-01","text":"Find the project brief.","start":2931,"end":2963,"words":[{"w":"Find","f":2933},{"w":"the","f":2940},{"w":"project","f":2945},{"w":"brief.","f":2955}]},{"id":"allow-block-02","text":"The agent calls the search tool, the gateway allows it, and the brief comes back.","start":2997,"end":3123,"words":[{"w":"The","f":3000},{"w":"agent","f":3006},{"w":"calls","f":3014},{"w":"the","f":3023},{"w":"search","f":3029},{"w":"tool,","f":3038},{"w":"the","f":3050},{"w":"gateway","f":3057},{"w":"allows","f":3067},{"w":"it,","f":3077},{"w":"and","f":3087},{"w":"the","f":3093},{"w":"brief","f":3099},{"w":"comes","f":3107},{"w":"back.","f":3116}]},{"id":"allow-block-03","text":"Now I’ll trigger a delete request to show what happens when the agent asks for something riskier.","start":3195,"end":3324,"words":[{"w":"Now","f":3196},{"w":"I’ll","f":3201},{"w":"trigger","f":3207},{"w":"a","f":3217},{"w":"delete","f":3221},{"w":"request","f":3230},{"w":"to","f":3240},{"w":"show","f":3245},{"w":"what","f":3251},{"w":"happens","f":3258},{"w":"when","f":3268},{"w":"the","f":3275},{"w":"agent","f":3281},{"w":"asks","f":3289},{"w":"for","f":3296},{"w":"something","f":3302},{"w":"riskier.","f":3314}]},{"id":"allow-block-04","text":"The agent wants to delete the client-files folder.","start":3417,"end":3488,"words":[{"w":"The","f":3419},{"w":"agent","f":3425},{"w":"wants","f":3433},{"w":"to","f":3442},{"w":"delete","f":3447},{"w":"the","f":3456},{"w":"client-files","f":3462},{"w":"folder.","f":3478}]},{"id":"allow-block-05","text":"The gateway pauses the call before it reaches the file tool.","start":3531,"end":3611,"words":[{"w":"The","f":3533},{"w":"gateway","f":3539},{"w":"pauses","f":3549},{"w":"the","f":3557},{"w":"call","f":3563},{"w":"before","f":3569},{"w":"it","f":3578},{"w":"reaches","f":3582},{"w":"the","f":3592},{"w":"file","f":3597},{"w":"tool.","f":3604}]},{"id":"allow-block-06","text":"Look at the approval card.","start":3681,"end":3715,"words":[{"w":"Look","f":3683},{"w":"at","f":3689},{"w":"the","f":3693},{"w":"approval","f":3698},{"w":"card.","f":3709}]},{"id":"allow-block-07","text":"I can see the action, the exact folder it targets, and which agent requested it.","start":3759,"end":3897,"words":[{"w":"I","f":3760},{"w":"can","f":3764},{"w":"see","f":3771},{"w":"the","f":3778},{"w":"action,","f":3785},{"w":"the","f":3801},{"w":"exact","f":3808},{"w":"folder","f":3817},{"w":"it","f":3828},{"w":"targets,","f":3833},{"w":"and","f":3851},{"w":"which","f":3858},{"w":"agent","f":3867},{"w":"requested","f":3877},{"w":"it.","f":3892}]},{"id":"allow-block-08","text":"I know exactly what I’m being asked to approve.","start":3957,"end":4018,"words":[{"w":"I","f":3959},{"w":"know","f":3962},{"w":"exactly","f":3969},{"w":"what","f":3978},{"w":"I’m","f":3985},{"w":"being","f":3989},{"w":"asked","f":3996},{"w":"to","f":4004},{"w":"approve.","f":4008}]},{"id":"allow-block-09","text":"I’ll hit Deny.","start":4083,"end":4109,"words":[{"w":"I’ll","f":4085},{"w":"hit","f":4092},{"w":"Deny.","f":4100}]},{"id":"allow-block-11","text":"The folder is still here.","start":4209,"end":4244,"words":[{"w":"The","f":4212},{"w":"folder","f":4217},{"w":"is","f":4225},{"w":"still","f":4230},{"w":"here.","f":4237}]},{"id":"allow-block-12","text":"And in the activity log, you can see both events.","start":4287,"end":4365,"words":[{"w":"And","f":4290},{"w":"in","f":4296},{"w":"the","f":4301},{"w":"activity","f":4307},{"w":"log,","f":4319},{"w":"you","f":4330},{"w":"can","f":4336},{"w":"see","f":4342},{"w":"both","f":4348},{"w":"events.","f":4355}]},{"id":"allow-block-13","text":"The search ran.","start":4425,"end":4454,"words":[{"w":"The","f":4428},{"w":"search","f":4435},{"w":"ran.","f":4447}]},{"id":"allow-block-14","text":"The deletion was requested and denied before it could run.","start":4479,"end":4565,"words":[{"w":"The","f":4481},{"w":"deletion","f":4488},{"w":"was","f":4500},{"w":"requested","f":4506},{"w":"and","f":4520},{"w":"denied","f":4526},{"w":"before","f":4536},{"w":"it","f":4545},{"w":"could","f":4550},{"w":"run.","f":4559}]},{"id":"approve-undo-00","text":"Sometimes the agent is supposed to make a change.","start":4665,"end":4729,"words":[{"w":"Sometimes","f":4667},{"w":"the","f":4679},{"w":"agent","f":4684},{"w":"is","f":4691},{"w":"supposed","f":4696},{"w":"to","f":4706},{"w":"make","f":4711},{"w":"a","f":4717},{"w":"change.","f":4720}]},{"id":"approve-undo-01","text":"Here it’s asking to rename project-brief.md to final-brief.md.","start":4802,"end":4948,"words":[{"w":"Here","f":4805},{"w":"it’s","f":4818},{"w":"asking","f":4829},{"w":"to","f":4847},{"w":"rename","f":4856},{"w":"project-brief.md","f":4873},{"w":"to","f":4909},{"w":"final-brief.md.","f":4917}]},{"id":"approve-undo-02","text":"The card shows the current name and the proposed name, so I can see the change before I approve it.","start":4980,"end":5108,"words":[{"w":"The","f":4983},{"w":"card","f":4988},{"w":"shows","f":4994},{"w":"the","f":5001},{"w":"current","f":5006},{"w":"name","f":5015},{"w":"and","f":5022},{"w":"the","f":5027},{"w":"proposed","f":5032},{"w":"name,","f":5042},{"w":"so","f":5052},{"w":"I","f":5056},{"w":"can","f":5059},{"w":"see","f":5065},{"w":"the","f":5070},{"w":"change","f":5075},{"w":"before","f":5083},{"w":"I","f":5091},{"w":"approve","f":5094},{"w":"it.","f":5103}]},{"id":"approve-undo-03","text":"I’ll approve this one.","start":5208,"end":5237,"words":[{"w":"I’ll","f":5210},{"w":"approve","f":5215},{"w":"this","f":5225},{"w":"one.","f":5231}]},{"id":"approve-undo-04","text":"The gateway forwards the call, and the new filename appears in the workspace.","start":5280,"end":5390,"words":[{"w":"The","f":5282},{"w":"gateway","f":5287},{"w":"forwards","f":5298},{"w":"the","f":5309},{"w":"call,","f":5315},{"w":"and","f":5327},{"w":"the","f":5333},{"w":"new","f":5339},{"w":"filename","f":5344},{"w":"appears","f":5356},{"w":"in","f":5367},{"w":"the","f":5371},{"w":"workspace.","f":5377}]},{"id":"approve-undo-06","text":"Now imagine I approved too quickly.","start":5548,"end":5602,"words":[{"w":"Now","f":5549},{"w":"imagine","f":5555},{"w":"I","f":5567},{"w":"approved","f":5571},{"w":"too","f":5584},{"w":"quickly.","f":5591}]},{"id":"approve-undo-07","text":"This was still a draft.","start":5646,"end":5679,"words":[{"w":"This","f":5650},{"w":"was","f":5656},{"w":"still","f":5661},{"w":"a","f":5669},{"w":"draft.","f":5672}]},{"id":"approve-undo-08","text":"I can click Undo, and the gateway uses the recorded original filename to reverse the rename.","start":5731,"end":5882,"words":[{"w":"I","f":5733},{"w":"can","f":5737},{"w":"click","f":5744},{"w":"Undo,","f":5753},{"w":"and","f":5767},{"w":"the","f":5773},{"w":"gateway","f":5780},{"w":"uses","f":5792},{"w":"the","f":5800},{"w":"recorded","f":5807},{"w":"original","f":5820},{"w":"filename","f":5834},{"w":"to","f":5847},{"w":"reverse","f":5852},{"w":"the","f":5864},{"w":"rename.","f":5871}]},{"id":"approve-undo-09","text":"Undo depends on the action.","start":5960,"end":6004,"words":[{"w":"Undo","f":5961},{"w":"depends","f":5969},{"w":"on","f":5981},{"w":"the","f":5987},{"w":"action.","f":5993}]},{"id":"approve-undo-10","text":"A rename can be reversed when the file is still in the expected state.","start":6045,"end":6144,"words":[{"w":"A","f":6047},{"w":"rename","f":6050},{"w":"can","f":6059},{"w":"be","f":6065},{"w":"reversed","f":6070},{"w":"when","f":6081},{"w":"the","f":6088},{"w":"file","f":6094},{"w":"is","f":6101},{"w":"still","f":6106},{"w":"in","f":6114},{"w":"the","f":6118},{"w":"expected","f":6124},{"w":"state.","f":6136}]},{"id":"approve-undo-11","text":"An email that’s already been delivered may be impossible to take back.","start":6248,"end":6346,"words":[{"w":"An","f":6251},{"w":"email","f":6256},{"w":"that’s","f":6264},{"w":"already","f":6272},{"w":"been","f":6283},{"w":"delivered","f":6290},{"w":"may","f":6302},{"w":"be","f":6308},{"w":"impossible","f":6313},{"w":"to","f":6327},{"w":"take","f":6332},{"w":"back.","f":6339}]},{"id":"approve-undo-12","text":"The approval step is especially important for those actions.","start":6425,"end":6514,"words":[{"w":"The","f":6428},{"w":"approval","f":6434},{"w":"step","f":6447},{"w":"is","f":6454},{"w":"especially","f":6459},{"w":"important","f":6474},{"w":"for","f":6488},{"w":"those","f":6494},{"w":"actions.","f":6503}]},{"id":"audit-00","text":"If I hand this workspace to a teammate tomorrow, they can open the log and reconstruct the whole sequence.","start":6615,"end":6761,"words":[{"w":"If","f":6617},{"w":"I","f":6622}